@startuml UC004_CV_Update_Sequence
!theme plain
title UC004 — Update profile information and CV PDF

actor "Owner" as Owner
participant "src/server.js" as Server
participant "src/routes/cv.routes.js" as Routes
participant "src/middleware/requireAuth.js" as Guard
participant "src/services/cvService.js" as Service
participant "src/domain/cvRules.js" as Rules
participant "src/services/cvStorage.js" as Storage
participant "src/db/database.js" as Data
database PostgreSQL as DB

note over Owner
  Fill in the profile fields, optionally select a PDF,
  then click Save profile once.
end note

Owner -> Server : PUT /api/profile/me (fields and optional PDF)
Server -> Routes : Dispatch profile save
Routes -> Guard : Verify owner session
Guard --> Routes : Set req.user
Routes -> Service : Save profile and attachment for req.user.id
Service -> Rules : Validate fields and optional PDF
opt Owner selected a new or replacement PDF
  Service -> Storage : Stage PDF under a new object key
  Storage --> Service : Object key
end
Service -> Data : Save fields and apply the attachment change
Data -> DB : Commit profile and attachment reference in one transaction
DB --> Data : Commit succeeded
Data --> Service : Saved profile and attachment metadata
Service --> Routes : Saved profile, public ID, and attachment metadata
Routes --> Owner : 200 OK

note over Owner, Routes
  The public view shows the saved fields and current PDF
  after the transaction commits.
end note
@enduml
